'''Shadow Cosmopolis''' (暗黒コスモポリス ''Ankoku Kosumoporisu'', '''Dark Cosmopolis''') is the 30th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A very hard sub-chapter. You could even say that it's harder than [[Intrepid Cats]]! By this point in the game, it's recommended to have at least some of the [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed/Manic Cats]] upgraded to level 30 or above (particularly [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall/Manic Eraser]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale/Manic Island]]) or else the chances of you struggling will increase. The hardest stage is probably [[Subterranean Stalker]], featuring an onslaught of [[Pigeon de Sable]]s and [[Brollow]]s protecting [[Mr. Mole]]s and [[Tackey]]s.

{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Boraphim]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Bore]]. Has immense health, crushing attacks, faster movement speed and more knockbacks.

